{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba10c91c457b2ed650399728443d4c7d50111e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1^{4y-1}}{5^{-1}+3^{-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/5556613c7ede0ec626acbaa949df7647256829f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{4y-1}{8} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{15}{2} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{15}{8} \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"426\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We simplify the expression to yield:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/5/a1564b3b435b2f5e366aceb6c90e2573e8ee623e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1^{4y-1}}{5^{-1}+3^{-1}}=\\dfrac{1}{5^{-1}+3^{-1}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\dfrac{1}{5}+\\dfrac{1}{3}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\dfrac{8}{15}}=\\dfrac{15}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -35px\" width=\"360\" height=\"63\" />.\n</p><p>Thus our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ffc10fac423297f0dadb75260c0fa9f31b5c642.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{15}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"69\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" ti